    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρει-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος</span>)
		pecul. fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρειος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
				mountains,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρα ὀ.</span>
			<i>mountain</i> crag, ib.<i><span class="en">
				219.5
			</span></i> (Antip.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				1.219
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Oread, mountain-nymph,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Bion
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				6.259
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19.331
			</span></i>.</div>
